Example::::


Case 1 : Consider line AB
Outcode (A) = ABRL = 0000
Outcode (B) = ABRL= 0000
Algorithm says that if the outcodes of both endpoints of the line are 0000, then the line is fully
visible (accepted).

Case 2 : Consider line CD
Outcode (C) = ABRL= 0100
Outcode (D) = ABRL= 0100
0100 AND 0100 ---- 0100
If the result of the AND operation is non-zero, then the line is surely outside the clipping window.
Therefore, Line CD is clipped (rejected).

