Intersection Point Calculation in Cohen–Sutherland Line Clipping Algorithm
We know the coordinates of the window:
● Lower Left Corner = (XL, YL)
● Upper Right Corner = (XH, YH)
As we have to find the intersection point with the left edge of the window.

